messages.content:
Two possibilities remain, and both mean the machine needs both nexioms together:
- {logibos, beremo}
- {beremo, lokaser}

The one-nexiom pair {lokaser, kimofo} is ruled out, because lokaser was on the machine in the last test and it stayed dark.

Testing beremo with lokaser settles it. If it lights up, the nexioms are beremo and lokaser. If it stays dark, they are logibos and beremo.

TEST: beremo, lokaser
